# Inspector's Gadget! (windurst 41): Kohlo-Lakolo and the brigade (Port Windurst), Chamama (Windurst Waters). Truth,
# Justice, and the Onion Way! and Know One's Onions completed by GM (the earlier quests silent), level 5. The offer's
# operands: fame 49 (level 1), no mustZone: 401; fame 50 (level 2) with this quest's char-var mustZone set by GM
# (nothing else sets it): 401; a warp out and back (the mustZone cleared): a bone chip traded while available, the check
# holding (no trade handler: nothing); 413 option 1 and option 2 (nothing), 413 option 0 (begun). Accepted, no
# moustache: Kohlo-Lakolo 414; the lines 417, 416, 418, 420, 419 (0, Linkshell). Chamama at Prog 0: the quest's nil (In
# a Pickle accepted by GM, so her script answers 655 at once, with no draw); at Prog -1 (GM; `> 0`): nil, 655; four
# balls traded at Prog 0 and at Prog 1 (the trade wants Prog 2): nil (her script: not a smooth stone: nothing).
# Pichichi's 415 (0, moustache): Prog 0: Prog 1; again at Prog 1: stays 1; at Prog -1 (GM; `== 0`): stays -1. Chamama at
# Prog 1: 551 (0, moustache): Prog 2; again at Prog 2: 551 again (Progress: her script never gets the turn), Prog stays
# 2; at Prog 3 (GM; `== 1`): 551, stays 3, and four balls traded at Prog 3: nil. At Prog 2: a bone chip, three balls,
# five balls, four plus a chip (each nil); four (552: taken, the Fake Moustache). With it: Chamama 553 (an Event: the
# next talk is her script's turn, 655); four more balls: nil (the moustache held); Prog 0 by GM with the moustache: 553
# (the moustache arm first). Prog 2 again; Pichichi at Prog 2: 415, stays 2. Fame 105 by GM. Kohlo-Lakolo: 421 with a
# full bag (the Heko Obi does not fit: nothing), then 421 (completed: fame 20 (125), the obi, Fake-Moustached
# Investigator, the player local var [2][42]mustZone 1; the moustache stays). Completed while Onion Rings is available:
# 425, 424, 423, 426, 428, 427 (replaceDefault). Kohlo-Lakolo: Onion Rings' offer (fame level 3, its own char-var
# mustZone 0: the local var 421 set is not read; no Old Ring): 429, finished (Onion Rings Prog 1, EndTime; still
# available): Gomada-Vulmada 425 (Onion Rings' section 2 wants it accepted). Onion Rings accepted by GM: section 3 not
# met; Gomada-Vulmada plays Onion Rings' in-time 435; its Prog 0 by GM (silent): 363. While this quest is available:
# Gomada-Vulmada twice, Know One's Onions' 405 both times (section 3's status operand false: no 425). Defaults: Chamama
# has none in DefaultActions (her script always answers). Also named: Chamama by The Promise (needs Wild Card completed:
# silent here).
lists PortWindurst/Kohlo-Lakolo/onTrigger PortWindurst/Pichichi/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Chamama/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Chamama/onTrade PortWindurst/onEventFinish/413 PortWindurst/onEventFinish/415 PortWindurst/onEventFinish/421 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/551 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/552
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-27.5,-8.0,189.6 lvl=5
fame Windurst 49
quest Windurst.TruthJusticeAndTheOnionWay completed
quest Windurst.KnowOnesOnions completed
quest Windurst.InAPickle accepted
item BoneChip
item BallOfSarutaCotton x12
login
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # fame level 1: 401
finish
fame Windurst 50                               # GM
charvar Quest[2][41]mustZone 240               # GM
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # fame level 2, the mustZone: 401
finish
warp -24.5,-14.498,262.994 WindurstWalls
warp -27.5,-8.0,189.6 PortWindurst             # the mustZone cleared
trade Kohlo-Lakolo BoneChip x1                 # available, the check holds: no trade handler: nothing
trigger Gomada-Vulmada                         # Know One's Onions' completed section: 405
finish
trigger Gomada-Vulmada                         # 405 again (section 3 wants this quest completed: no 425 to cycle with)
finish
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # 413
finish option=1                                # not 0: nothing
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # 413
finish option=2                                # not 0: nothing
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # 413
finish option=0                                # begun
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # no moustache: 414
finish
trigger Gomada-Vulmada                         # 417
finish
trigger Papo-Hopo                              # 416
finish
trigger Pyo_Nzon                               # 418
finish
trigger Shanruru                               # 420
finish
trigger Yafa_Yaa                               # 419 (0, Linkshell)
finish
warp -68.7,-3.8,-4.4 WindurstWaters
trigger Chamama                                # Prog 0, no moustache: nil; her script: In a Pickle accepted: 655
finish
charvar Quest[2][41]Prog -1                    # GM
trigger Chamama                                # Prog -1: not > 0: nil; 655
finish
charvar Quest[2][41]Prog 0                     # GM
trade Chamama BallOfSarutaCotton x4            # Prog 0: nil (her script: not a smooth stone: nothing)
warp -27.5,-8.0,189.6 PortWindurst
trigger Pichichi                               # 415 (0, moustache)
finish                                         # Prog 0: Prog 1
trigger Pichichi                               # 415
finish                                         # Prog 1: nothing
charvar Quest[2][41]Prog -1                    # GM
trigger Pichichi                               # 415
finish                                         # Prog -1: not 0: nothing
charvar Quest[2][41]Prog 1                     # GM
warp -68.7,-3.8,-4.4 WindurstWaters
trade Chamama BallOfSarutaCotton x4            # Prog 1: nil
trigger Chamama                                # Prog 1: 551 (0, moustache)
finish                                         # Prog 2
trigger Chamama                                # Prog 2, no moustache: 551 again (Progress)
finish                                         # Prog 2: nothing
charvar Quest[2][41]Prog 3                     # GM
trigger Chamama                                # Prog 3: 551
finish                                         # not 1: nothing
trade Chamama BallOfSarutaCotton x4            # Prog 3: nil
charvar Quest[2][41]Prog 2                     # GM
trade Chamama BoneChip x1                      # wrong item: nil
trade Chamama BallOfSarutaCotton x3            # three: nil
trade Chamama BallOfSarutaCotton x5            # five: nil
trade Chamama BallOfSarutaCotton x4 BoneChip x1   # four plus an extra: nil
trade Chamama BallOfSarutaCotton x4            # 552
finish                                         # the cotton taken; the Fake Moustache
trigger Chamama                                # the moustache: 553 (Event)
finish
trigger Chamama                                # the alternation: her script's turn: 655
finish
trade Chamama BallOfSarutaCotton x4            # the moustache held: nil
charvar Quest[2][41]Prog 0                     # GM
trigger Chamama                                # the moustache, Prog 0: 553
finish
charvar Quest[2][41]Prog 2                     # GM
warp -27.5,-8.0,189.6 PortWindurst
trigger Pichichi                               # 415
finish                                         # Prog 2: nothing
fame Windurst 105                              # GM
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # the moustache: 421
fill-inventory
finish                                         # full: quest:complete false: nothing
free-inventory
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # 421
finish                                         # completed: fame 20, the Heko Obi, the title; local var [2][42]mustZone 1
trigger Gomada-Vulmada                         # Onion Rings available: 425 (replaceDefault)
finish
trigger Papo-Hopo                              # 424
finish
trigger Pichichi                               # 423
finish
trigger Pyo_Nzon                               # 426
finish
trigger Shanruru                               # 428
finish
trigger Yafa_Yaa                               # 427
finish
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # Onion Rings' offer: fame 125 (level 3), no ring: its 429
finish                                         # Onion Rings: Prog 1, EndTime 790192656 (still available)
trigger Gomada-Vulmada                         # Onion Rings available: 425
finish
quest Windurst.OnionRings accepted             # GM
trigger Gomada-Vulmada                         # section 3 not met; Onion Rings' in-time 435
finish
charvar Quest[2][42]Prog 0                     # GM: Onion Rings at Prog 0 (none of its sections)
trigger Gomada-Vulmada                         # section 3's quest operand false, no other line: 363
